4 compared to 2022</strong>, which is of particular concern given 2022’s historic 8-point drop in 8th grade math.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f30cb6ba09148a00\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nagb.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"40940d1190616d4f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAssessments - Mathematics | NAEP\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"40940d1190616d4f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/mathematics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac17e6457c50f212\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCompared to 2022, the average mathematics score was higher for grade 4 and not significantly different for grade 8. The national average score for Grade 12 was lower in 2024 than in 2019.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac17e6457c50f212\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"August 20, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nces.ed.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d8d33fa98a9f2546\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 MATHEMATICS STATE SNAPSHOT REPORT ALASKA  GRADE 8  PUBLIC SCHOOLS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d8d33fa98a9f2546\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://education.alaska.gov/assessments/snapshot_MAT2022AK_8.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5df61f2bfdee8504\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIn 2022, the <strong>average score of eighth-grade students in Alaska was 270</strong>. This was · lower than the average score of 273 for students in the nation.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5df61f2bfdee8504\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"education.alaska.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"460edbc94b35eaf6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2024 MATHEMATICS STATE SNAPSHOT REPORT CALIFORNIA  GRADE 8  PUBLIC SCHOOLS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"460edbc94b35ea