erage scores that were not significantly different from the national public average; and 17 scored higher. Explore detailed state average score results in the NAEP Mathematics Report Card\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ffa7dac4269baad\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nationsreportcard.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a7daffe75b279cc2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nColorado 2022 NAEP Grade 8 Math Graphics\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a7daffe75b279cc2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cde.state.co.us/assessment/colorado2022naepgrade8mathgraphics\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ee9358771043ee57\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCDE Assessment - Information about Colorado K-12 public schools, school districts, and the Colorado State Board of Education.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ee9358771043ee57\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cde.state.co.us\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d5e5dee058013807\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 National Assessment of Educational Progress Grade 8 Mathematics Results\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d5e5dee058013807\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.fldoe.org/core/fileparse.php/7667/urlt/2022NAEPGrade8Math.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ff09fc5b16c40601\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAverage Scale Scores: 2022............................................................................... 19 ... of structural prompts such as diagrams, charts, and graphs. They should be able to solve problems in · all NAEP content areas through the appropriate selection and use of strategies ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ff09fc5b16c40601\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.fldoe.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a90048ccb6f1661f\\\">>>\\